      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'd be happy to help you craft a powerful rebuttal. Here's a possible section for your fundraising speech:\n\n\"As we gather here tonight, many of you may have heard the familiar criticism that foreign aid is a luxury we can't afford, and that our scarce resources would be better spent on the needs of our own citizens. But I'd like to counter this narrative with a more compassionate and historically-grounded reality. For generations, the international community has come together to address global crises, such as pandemics, famines, and conflicts, because we recognize that no nation is immune to suffering, and that the fate of our own people is tied to the well-being of others. By investing in global development and humanitarian assistance, we are not only alleviating suffering and advancing peace, but also safeguarding the stability and security of our own societies – and our own future.\"",
